   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "COLOR\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 7, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Black and white to full color\n   2 Color filter\n   3 Filter color\n   4 Number of main colors\n   5 One color that pops\n   6 Warm to cool\n   7 Color change in the scene\n   8 How true skin looks\n   9 suite: Color lens\n  10 suite: The whole look\n  11 suite: Teal and orange\n  12 suite: Faded memory\n  13 suite: Black and white with one color\n  14 suite: Bleak gray\n  15 pair: When the color filter gets strong, the number of main colors drops\n  16 pair: When anger rises, the color runs warm\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 7, CC 33 to 38\n   1 pair: When fear rises, the color drains\n   2 pair: When one color pops, the audience's eye locks on it\n   3 pair: When the filter turns red, the danger feels close\n   4 pair: When skin color looks far from real, the audience feels something is wrong\n   5 pairs: Color follows the feeling\n   6 pairs: One red thing"
   },
